				<r3d:repositoryUrl>https://refodat.de</r3d:repositoryUrl>
				<r3d:description language="eng">The research data repository primarily serves to publish data that is submitted directly by researchers at Thuringian universities and for which no suitable specialist repository is available. In addition, the repository provides interfaces that make it possible to import collected and possibly curated stocks from other systems (e.g. work platforms) that cannot guarantee permanent availability. The assignment of DOI, the linking of data authors and data sets with additional IDs and resources (including ORCIDs, ROR, GND) as well as export and citation functions (such as JSON-LD or BibTeX) are supported. Data sets from researchers at Thuringian universities that have already been published in other specialist repositories can at least be registered in the repository.</r3d:description>
